From 5012bed01b78c6ad3fbdca4cc4905e47d002d8d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexander Gavris <GavrisAS@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 13:15:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] hwmon: (asus-ec-sensors) add ROG CROSSHAIR X870E DARK HERO

The ROG CROSSHAIR X870E DARK HERO is missing an exact DMI match. Its
external T_SENSOR header uses the AMD 800-series EC mapping at bank 0,
index 0x36. Reuse that mapping and the board's existing SIO1.MUT0
ACPI mutex, exposing only T_Sensor.

Tested on an ASUS ROG CROSSHAIR X870E DARK HERO. Idle readings ranged
from 32 to 33 degrees Celsius. During about 60 seconds at 100% GPU
utilization and 600 W, T_Sensor rose to 33 degrees, peaked at 35
degrees shortly after the load stopped, and returned to 32 degrees
during the seven-minute cooldown. The EC reading has 1 degree
resolution.

Signed-off-by: Alexander Gavris <GavrisAS@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/hwmon/asus_ec_sensors.rst | 1 +
 drivers/hwmon/asus-ec-sensors.c         | 8 ++++++++
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/hwmon/asus_ec_sensors.rst b/Documentation/hwmon/asus_ec_sensors.rst
index 2c68a343a..fb61caecc 100644
--- a/Documentation/hwmon/asus_ec_sensors.rst
+++ b/Documentation/hwmon/asus_ec_sensors.rst
@@ -26,6 +26,7 @@ Supported boards:
  * ROG CROSSHAIR X670E EXTREME
  * ROG CROSSHAIR X670E HERO
  * ROG CROSSHAIR X670E GENE
+ * ROG CROSSHAIR X870E DARK HERO
  * ROG CROSSHAIR X870E HERO
  * ROG MAXIMUS X HERO
  * ROG MAXIMUS XI HERO
diff --git a/drivers/hwmon/asus-ec-sensors.c b/drivers/hwmon/asus-ec-sensors.c
index e43645e88..2a3df065b 100644
--- a/drivers/hwmon/asus-ec-sensors.c
+++ b/drivers/hwmon/asus-ec-sensors.c
@@ -511,6 +511,12 @@ static const struct ec_board_info board_info_crosshair_x870e_hero = {
 	.family = family_amd_800_series,
 };
 
+static const struct ec_board_info board_info_crosshair_x870e_dark_hero = {
+	.sensors = SENSOR_TEMP_T_SENSOR,
+	.mutex_path = ASUS_HW_ACCESS_MUTEX_SB_PCI0_SBRG_SIO1_MUT0,
+	.family = family_amd_800_series,
+};
+
 static const struct ec_board_info board_info_maximus_vi_hero = {
 	.sensors = SENSOR_SET_TEMP_CHIPSET_CPU_MB |
 		SENSOR_TEMP_T_SENSOR |
@@ -924,6 +930,8 @@ static const struct dmi_system_id dmi_table[] = {
 					&board_info_crosshair_x670e_gene),
 	DMI_EXACT_MATCH_ASUS_BOARD_NAME("ROG CROSSHAIR X670E HERO",
 					&board_info_crosshair_x670e_hero),
+	DMI_EXACT_MATCH_ASUS_BOARD_NAME("ROG CROSSHAIR X870E DARK HERO",
+					&board_info_crosshair_x870e_dark_hero),
 	DMI_EXACT_MATCH_ASUS_BOARD_NAME("ROG CROSSHAIR X870E HERO",
 					&board_info_crosshair_x870e_hero),
 	DMI_EXACT_MATCH_ASUS_BOARD_NAME("ROG MAXIMUS XI HERO",
